# Tiled Floor Plane (Double-Sided)
# Size: 200x200 units
# Texture Repeat: 50x50 times

# Vertices (X Y Z)
v -1.0 0.0  1.0
v  1.0 0.0  1.0
v  1.0 0.0 -1.0
v -1.0 0.0 -1.0

